# Test-run output, not fixtures. `tests/file_processing.rs` writes these on
# every run and compares against the `expected-*` files instead; tracking them
# means a diff after every `cargo test`, always in the `##` header timings that
# `normalize_log` deliberately ignores.
tests/data/input/*/stdout*.log
